{"title":"One or two game theoretic observations","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920157140/0/marginalrevolution~One-or-two-game-theoretic-observations.html","date":1749796098000,"content":"<p>So far the campaign is a major “win” for (non-LLM) AI, though that is not yet a story.  There is a reason why Palantir was priced at 300x earnings.</p>\r\n<p>If you are one of those Iranian leaders, or nuclear scientists, your calculus has to be that you can never step outside again, at least not anytime soon.  I believe that situation is unprecedented in the history of wartime?  It remains to be seen how much that will shape the logic of deterrence and in turn outcomes, but I will be pondering this and observing.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/when-will-israel-attack-iranian-nuclear-facilities.html\" target=\"_blank\">POTMR</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/one-or-two-game-theoretic-observations.html\">One or two game theoretic observations</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920157140/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920157140/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920157140/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920157140/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920157140/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.